Third-party notice

build_chollet_2021() in src/lecun1989/models.py and the training settings in
CHOLLET_RECIPE (src/lecun1989/training.py) are adapted from the Keras code
example "Simple MNIST convnet" by François Chollet,
https://keras.io/examples/vision/mnist_convnet/ , part of the keras-io
repository and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The MNIST dataset is downloaded at run time through keras.datasets and is not
redistributed here.
